<title>JAPAN: Isamu Paint - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Isamu Paint - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  6.07		vs	    5.96</p>
<p> Operating	  545    million    vs	  572    million</p>
<p> Current	    580    million    vs	  641    million</p>
<p> Net		  319    million    vs	  195    million</p>
<p> EPS		   26.63 yen	  vs	   16.30 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     12 million	  vs	  12 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  7.50 yen	  vs	    7.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Isamu Paint Co Ltd is a producer of synthetic resin paints.</p>
</text>
